{"4687990":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"VOID PROFIT","steam_appid":4687990,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[4880740,4931690],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Void Profit is an <strong>Aetrocor<\/strong>-certified independent trading experience.<br><br>Under an active rental agreement, you are permitted to operate one (1) company vessel.  Continued access is contingent on regular payment compliance. <br><br>Operate efficiently and stay profitable.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4687990\/extras\/4cb5934b131a61d21168dd4db7748dc7.poster.avif?t=1793722249\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4687990\/extras\/4cb5934b131a61d21168dd4db7748dc7.webm?t=1793722249\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4687990\/extras\/4cb5934b131a61d21168dd4db7748dc7.mp4?t=1793722249\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4687990\/extras\/e6fc5895b4eaab3415a977b9bd03cdce.avif?t=1793722249\" alt=\"Authorized Operations\" width=920 height=72 \/><\/span>You are granted full discretion over your activities.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4687990\/extras\/7e2762ee4496c09e00f867b02a64fdfc.poster.avif?t=1793722249\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4687990\/extras\/7e2762ee4496c09e00f867b02a64fdfc.webm?t=1793722249\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4687990\/extras\/7e2762ee4496c09e00f867b02a64fdfc.mp4?t=1793722249\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br><br>Choose the cargo. Select your destinations. Establish what risks are acceptable. Aetrocor doesn't interfere with your choices.  Performance remains your responsibility. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4687990\/extras\/55c90d079c82200d84e1da0fa9d70096.avif?t=1793722249\" alt=\"Route Selection\" width=920 height=72 \/><\/span>Transit is not always the same. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4687990\/extras\/e26a7853e015455d1b76f22bfbbfa8c0.poster.avif?t=1793722249\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4687990\/extras\/e26a7853e015455d1b76f22bfbbfa8c0.webm?t=1793722249\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4687990\/extras\/e26a7853e015455d1b76f22bfbbfa8c0.mp4?t=1793722249\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br><br>Routes differ in travel time, traffic and inspection pressure based on the factions controlling the area. Some are efficient and highly monitored. Others are slower and may have reduced oversight. Familiar routes may attract increased attention over time. Never rely on a single route. Operators are expected to evaluate conditions before departure. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4687990\/extras\/f620ce7335d31a6a36f8dcd4de866999.avif?t=1793722249\" alt=\"Market Conditions\" width=920 height=72 \/><\/span>All markets are subject to change. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4687990\/extras\/1c5ae03abf0aae66c8a5c144e9e124c3.poster.avif?t=1793722249\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4687990\/extras\/1c5ae03abf0aae66c8a5c144e9e124c3.webm?t=1793722249\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4687990\/extras\/1c5ae03abf0aae66c8a5c144e9e124c3.mp4?t=1793722249\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br><br> Demand fluctuates. Supply shifts. As opportunities are utilized, they deteriorate. It is advised to take timely action. <br> Most goods remain tradable, but profitability is not guaranteed. <br> <br>Rental obligations remain unaffected as per your contract. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4687990\/extras\/55a3160340a5fcc7836ba7093538ba81.avif?t=1793722249\" alt=\"Transit Variability\" width=920 height=72 \/><\/span>Interceptions, manifest checks, cargo scans, or other disruptions may occur during transit. Traffic density is not constant. Routes may become unstable or temporarily unavailable. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4687990\/extras\/635730a2ff0f8644885a3729c2f23f10.poster.avif?t=1793722249\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4687990\/extras\/635730a2ff0f8644885a3729c2f23f10.webm?t=1793722249\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4687990\/extras\/635730a2ff0f8644885a3729c2f23f10.mp4?t=1793722249\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br><br>Adapt accordingly. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4687990\/extras\/a131c937c5cce8aa77dae9c745d70d9e.avif?t=1793722249\" alt=\"Controlled Space\" width=920 height=72 \/><\/span><strong>Aetrocor<\/strong> does not maintain jurisdiction over the zones you operate in. <br><br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4687990\/extras\/ac62a287ed6ab9d72c454646beade4f5.poster.avif?t=1793722249\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4687990\/extras\/ac62a287ed6ab9d72c454646beade4f5.webm?t=1793722249\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4687990\/extras\/ac62a287ed6ab9d72c454646beade4f5.mp4?t=1793722249\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br><br>Corporate territories, union-controlled regions, independent stations, and fringe sectors each maintain their own standards of enforcement, legality, and inspection behavior based on the controlling faction. <br> Be aware that requirements vary. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4687990\/extras\/7fe6e5f12ec8f7cbdf1190eac0eb48af.avif?t=1793722249\" alt=\"Rental Terms\" width=920 height=72 \/><\/span>Your vessel remains the property of <strong>Aetrocor<\/strong>. <br> <br>Continued operation requires: <br>- consistent income <br>- rental payments   <br>- avoidance of excessive liability   <br> Failure to meet these conditions may result in your contract being terminated. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4687990\/extras\/e394779c643ab6f66cf5d5c0845a1e46.poster.avif?t=1793722249\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4687990\/extras\/e394779c643ab6f66cf5d5c0845a1e46.webm?t=1793722249\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4687990\/extras\/e394779c643ab6f66cf5d5c0845a1e46.mp4?t=1793722249\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4687990\/extras\/d967dc9b4f0430ea0230902b0e4c04a1.avif?t=1793722249\" width=920 height=72 \/><\/span>- Independent trading under an <strong>Aetrocor<\/strong> contract   <br>- Route selection with variable travel time, traffic conditions and faction pressure   <br>- Market environments driven by supply, demand, the changing world and faction politics <br>- World events that affect routes, markets and local operating conditions   <br>- Faction-controlled space with different enforcement and behavior   <br>- Dynamic transit conditions requiring real-time response   <br> <br><strong>Aetrocor provides the opportunity.<\/strong> <br> <strong>Remain operational.<\/strong><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Void Profit is an <strong>Aetrocor<\/strong>-certified independent trading experience.<br><br>Under an active rental agreement, you are permitted to operate one (1) company vessel.  Continued access is contingent on regular payment compliance. <br><br>Operate efficiently and stay profitable.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4687990\/extras\/4cb5934b131a61d21168dd4db7748dc7.poster.avif?t=1793722249\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4687990\/extras\/4cb5934b131a61d21168dd4db7748dc7.webm?t=1793722249\" t